        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Pursuant to the directions of this Court, the Government considered the representation and rejected the same in proceeding dated 14.03.2024 and the said proceeding came to be challenged in the present writ petition.\nM/S.Sri Sairam Impex vs "
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "268916ae674a441a9e5258724d017017_19",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Division Bench considered the positive factors of Masoor Dal and held that Masoor Dal has never been prohibited."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7ba54814f5454551b4d026f974c23b33_23",
        "summary_section": "arguments",
        "labels": [
          "ARG_PETITIONER"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "explicit_leakage_phrase"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [
          {
            "pattern": "\\bquashed\\b",
            "matched_text": "quashed",
            "start": 231,
            "end": 238
          }
        ],
        "text_preview": "Relying on the said observations, the learned Senior Counsel would contend that exclusion of Masoor Dal in the forthcoming tender notification by the Government of Tamil Nadu is untenable and therefore, the order impugned is to be quashed a"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "6e5183e0ff784bc8b0572ef3466968be_30",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Supply Corporation contains Beta Oxalyl Alanine a neuro toxin,\nwhich on sustained consumption can cause neuro lathyrism and affect the nervous system and cause various deformities."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a4a38a84ee774c978ec99ebff6747a90_31",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "A sample of Masoor Dal being supplied in Karur District was taken and sent for analysis to the public health laboratory in Chennai, and the report confirmed the presence of the toxin in the Dal test."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e142f59e9a23471db37c90089bbae783_32",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is therefore, requested to the Government to withdraw the supply of Masoor M/S.Sri Sairam Impex vs The Additional Chief Secretary on 30 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/98268565/\n3 Dal in the Noon Meal Programme an"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "75188eb352e1445998897a15642e120d_33",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n9. The Government vide G.O.Ms.No.28 of the Social Welfare and Nutritious Meal Programme Deparment dated 01.03.2007 had permitted the supply of Toor Dal instead of Masoor Dal for the purpose of Nutritious Meal Programme with immediate effec"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "1a1575b062474af391cce609b0129a00_34",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The third respondent was requested to withdraw Masoor Dal from the Nutritious Meal Programme in Schools and Anganwadi Centers and supply Toor Dal only."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "665e4bc21fbc446d96f119af4dcc49b3_35",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Based on the above order, the third respondent had stopped the supply of Masoor Dal for the Nutritious Meal Programme Scheme."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d88c72a4b5ab420e9f9f029e73478629_36",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is further contended that as Kesari Dal is a weed plant that mostly grows along with Masoor Dal."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "64046cbda31c4302ac384169be6b60e7_37",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "As the size of the Dal is similar to Masoor Dal, it is very difficult to remove the Kesari Dal from the Masoor Dal and hence, the the presence of Kesari https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Dal of at least about 0.02% - 0.03% in Masoor Dal is in"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "33f415b3bb2f40779dfe13cd908eac46_38",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In 2007, the modern technology of Grader (separator) and colour sorter machine for grading and sorting of pulses was introduced."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "046098e0ea5d4b47844a2b74a2a579f7_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, practically, it is very difficult to sort out and remove the Kesari Dal from the Masoor Dal and if such mixed Dal is supplied, it can have adverse health implications."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "24d3343057254524b8643ec40bbccf7b_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "10. During the year 2017, the first respondent made an attempt to procure Masoor Dal and issued G.O.Ms.No.33, Cooperation, Food and Consumer Protection Department dated 06.03.2017 and permitted the third respondent to decide on the verities"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "642d8c06417144c2b3b2bc7c03984564_41",
        "summary_section": "facts",
        "labels": [
          "RLC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_labels:RLC"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The said Government order was challenged before the Madurai Bench of Madras High Court as public Interest Litigation in W.P.(MD)No.12658 of 2017 and the writ petition was disposed of with a direction to ensure that Masoor Dal be supplied wi"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3aa9523a0bf0410797134487f62ed4ba_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, the cases referred on the side of the petitioners are relating to tender notifications issued."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "79df8c883d4540b48ed20d9ad9f0730d_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the present case, there is no such tender has been issued."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "c0e27fb8c11e417caeed2f19b3c05e51_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The petitioner cannot be construed as an aggrieved person as on today since no tender notification has been https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis flouted."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a378ff4bd67942e993cb04f6ca1e4661_45",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\nThe tender notification issued in the first instance was cancelled and subsequent tender notification was issued."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "24254702d99a402496b56e455fcf1a24_46",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "However, the petitioner has not participated in the said tender process since the petitioner is a supplier of Masoor Dal and Masoor Dal has been excluded in the tender notification."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e6bddaa559e94a38b09977679db15f18_47",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n11. No doubt, policy decision of the Government must be in the larger public interest."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "85e21b2a597f4637b043f0e7b6d29ecb_48",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Policy of the Government can be challenged on limited grounds."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3d7fcf6c7b8c4f4fa32bfc2281f833e0_49",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "High Court cannot act as an expert body with reference to the laboratory reports relied on by the Government."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a0490ff5ab3a40f485e5999cd01d24f0_50",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Government previously purchased the Masoor Dal and supplied the same through Public Distribution System."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "7257ba95de964b91863b16553d592a21_51",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Government experienced certain negative aspects and various instances referred in the counter would reveal that certain adverse health effects are noticed and more specifically the District Collector, Karur District, in a letter dated 2"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cba70165b3f64cd2b480a9f12b0e3aed_52",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Further, it is stated that it is very difficult to segregate Kesari Dal from the Masoor Dal https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis as the size of the Dal is similar to that of the Masoor Dal."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a9b12a5e9afe4d5a9561cf045d710f8c_53",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The presence of Kesari Dal of at least about 0.02 % - 0.03 % in Masoor Dal is inevitable."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ac6535da7f42404b9fe20499ea403ba4_54",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Government has considered the adverse health implications on the M/S.Sri Sairam Impex vs"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3d965c8a3a344712ad284dc01bf743de_55",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The Additional Chief Secretary on 30 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/98268565/\n4"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d0000d75c61c47868ba5ef1a15ea5b51_56",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Masoor Dal and the District Collector, Karur District, also submitted a report and further supply of Masoor Dal had been stopped by the Government."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8a3daa09def748109d3c2a50e335c0fc_57",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "12. Therefore, this Court is of the considered opinion that the decision to exclude the Masoon Dal has been taken based on certain health grounds and such health grounds relied on by the Government need not be interfered with by the Court."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "ccc60a8fe3394f859868e69f8f19deec_58",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "RATIO"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "That apart, the Court cannot direct the Government to adopt a policy decision to include the Masoor Dal in the Tender notifications."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0fda7a1149264c87a1bbef55037d8a19_59",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "For all these reasons, this Court do not find any reason to interfere."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "9fe1d0f82a1348b4a732b2b750ec7e08_60",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "13. Accordingly, the writ petition stands dismissed."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cf038a2b2e1c412582775540c0219a1a_61",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
